Package: shieldred5
Version: 1.1.2
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: ShieldRed 5 Maintainers <maintainers@shieldred5.local>
Depends: bash, parted, dosfstools, exfatprogs | exfat-utils, xz-utils, python3, util-linux
Recommends: nodejs (>= 18)
Description: Multi-boot USB preparation utility and offline Plugson configurator
 ShieldRed 5 (Red Ninja Hardened Edition) prepares bootable multi-ISO USB
 drives supporting MBR and GPT, BIOS and UEFI (including Secure Boot),
 non-destructive upgrades, and an optional offline Plugson web configurator.

